om&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL-a56JqjCr126PujO8eSq4Wugd50dADDIN0nbJBsC04w&oe=6AA3FA3A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "GunSpinning VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "GunSpinning VR is a rail shooter that takes place in a small city in the wild west. The city is invested by zombies and aliens and you have to clean it up to find the source of the infection.\n\n- Learn the game basics in the ranch by shooting bottles\n- Play and complete the game in story mode\n- Try  and challenge your best score\n- 1 level in this trial version (8 in full game)\n- Sweet Country musics", "short_description": "There are weird things in town, people have changed, they look different.. they look dead, but they are alive! I don\u2019t know why but this giant flying disc is probably responsible. It flew over my ranch, and left for the city. I\u2019ve to follow it."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.demonixis.net/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Demonixis Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.demonixis.net/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE", "HORROR"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "371769241493294"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PENDING", "id": "1079515900654016"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "497252822